---
layout: uncviet.njk
pageTitle: UNC Viet
description: UNC Viet — Vietnamese language courses and materials for UNC students, from the Open Vietnamese initiative.
---

<div class="uv-hero">
  <div class="uv-hero-row">
    <div class="uv-hero-badge"><img src="/uncviet/UNC-VIETNAM.png" alt="UNC Vietnam logo" /></div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Open Vietnamese · Active hub · {{ uncviet.semester }}</span>
      <h1>UNC Viet</h1>
      <div class="uv-handle">{{ uncviet.handle }} · {{ uncviet.tagline }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:16px;"><a href="/uncviet/UNCVIET-Program-Flyer.pdf" style="color:white;font-weight:600;">Download the program flyer (PDF) →</a></p>
</div>

<section class="uv-section">
  <div class="uv-section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Mission statement</span>
    <h2>The UNC Vietnamese Language Program</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="uv-mission">{{ uncviet.mission }}</p>
</section>

<section class="uv-section">
  <div class="uv-section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Program pillars</span>
    <h2>Doing · Becoming · Belonging</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="uv-pillars">
    {% for p in uncviet.pillars %}
      <div class="uv-pillar">
        <div class="uv-pillar-key">{{ p.key }}</div>
        <div class="uv-pillar-name">{{ p.name }}</div>
        <div class="uv-pillar-body">{{ p.body }}</div>
        <div class="uv-pillar-practice"><strong>In practice:</strong> {{ p.practice }}</div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="uv-section">
  <div class="uv-section-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Courses</span>
    <h2>Choose a course</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="course-grid">
    {% for c in uncviet.courses %}
      <a class="course-card" href="/uncviet/{{ c.slug }}/">
        <div class="course-code">{{ c.code }}</div>
        <div class="course-title">{{ c.title }}</div>
        <div class="course-level">{{ c.level }}</div>
        <div class="course-desc">{{ c.description }}</div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
    <a class="course-card" href="/uncviet/{{ uncviet.vlc.slug }}/">
      <div class="course-code">{{ uncviet.vlc.code }}</div>
      <div class="course-title">{{ uncviet.vlc.title }}</div>
      <div class="course-level">{{ uncviet.vlc.level }}</div>
      <div class="course-desc">{{ uncviet.vlc.description }}</div>
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="uv-note">
    All six Vietnamese language courses (VIET 101–306) are approved and listed in the catalog.
    VIET 101–204 are sequential; VIET 305 and VIET 306 are theme-based and may be taken in any
    order or independently. Coming soon: VIET/ASIA 324 — Vietnamese Foodways (scheduling pending).
    Planned: VIET/ASIA 224 — Vietnamese Pop Culture.
  </p>
</section>
